  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The ethyl bromide undergo elimination reaction with alc.KOH gives ethene.</p><p>Ethene gives dibromoethane with bromine in carbon tetra chloride. The dibromoethane converts to dicyanoethane with excess KCN. The dicyanoethane on hydrolysis gives Succinic Acid.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0036_435e9f7e209a.png\" style=\"width: 755px; height: 394px;\"/></p>"
